# Next.js / React

## App Router
- Pages live in `src/app/**/page.tsx`; SEO metadata in colocated `layout.tsx` or `src/app/meta.ts`
- Use `SITE_NAME` / `SITE_URL` from `@/lib/site-config` for titles and copy — do not hardcode brand strings
- Client components: add `"use client"` only when needed (hooks, events, browser APIs)

## Data fetching
- Prefer TanStack Query (`useQuery` / `useMutation`) with keys like `["homepage", "banners"]`
- Auth-aware calls: `useSession` + pass `accessToken` into services
- Middleware protects `/account`, `/dashboard`, `/profile`, `/admin` — do not duplicate that logic in every page

## Components
- Feature folders: `components/home`, `order`, `invoice`, `layouts`
- Reuse `CustomLink` for internal navigation when progress bar / SPA feel is needed
- Order draft localStorage key prefix: `kakilima:order:`

## Auth UX
- Login/register under `src/app/auth/`
- Guest can complete order; balance payment (`provider: "balance"`, id `0`) only when logged in
- Roles: `member` | `superadmin` (`src/lib/role.ts`) — no admin UI in this frontend unless requested
